      "text": "Reference: briareus-windows. Other clients match this structure, differing only as noted here.\nOpened from 📊 in the sidebar strip, which is shown active. It reads GET /usage/all (Admin), polls every 60 s, and ⟳ / F5 reads it again.\nThe header picker (calendar glyph) offers This month, Last month, All time, Today, Last 7 days and Last 30 days. The day/month unit switches the charts to 'Tokens per month' / 'Cost per month'.\nPickers read 'All X ▾'. Project and model pick several ('2 projects ▾'); the others pick one. Clicking a breakdown row toggles it as the filter, and a pick adds ' · only <name>' to the subtitle.\nRings appear only with 3 or more slices: four colours plus a grey 'Other'. The project table shows a bar in its slice colour. A project with no turns, or one removed, is greyed out.\nHovering a bar shows 'Oct 3: 4.1M tok · 62 turns · $21.40' at the right of the chart title. An empty window shows 'No usage recorded in October 2026.' above the insights and the project table.\nProvider quotas are not on this screen; they are on each provider's Settings → Status tab.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "originalText": "Reference: briareus-windows. Other clients match this structure, differing only as noted here.\nOpened from 📊 in the sidebar strip, which is shown active. It reads GET /usage/all (Admin), polls every 60 s, and ⟳ / F5 reads it again.\nThe header picker (calendar glyph) offers This month, Last month, All time, Today, Last 7 days and Last 30 days. The day/month unit switches the charts to 'Tokens per month' / 'Cost per month'.\nPickers read 'All X ▾'. Project and model pick several ('2 projects ▾'); the others pick one. Clicking a breakdown row toggles it as the filter, and a pick adds ' · only <name>' to the subtitle.\nRings appear only with 3 or more slices: four colours plus a grey 'Other'. The project table shows a bar in its slice colour. A project with no turns, or one removed, is greyed out.\nHovering a bar shows 'Oct 3: 4.1M tok · 62 turns · $21.40' at the right of the chart title. An empty window shows 'No usage recorded in October 2026.' above the insights and the project table.\nProvider quotas are not on this screen; they are on each provider's Settings → Status tab.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
